    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our can meet some of the client's requirements with our current technology stack. our have experience with cloud providers that offer SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, such as Outscale (SecNumCloud) and OVHcloud, which can fulfill the hosting requirement. our containerisation tools include Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm, which can help ensure high availability and scalability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our have experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack, which can aid in achieving the required 99.9% availability." ;
