    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding API integration, our expertise in API standards (REST, GraphQL) and API gateways (Kong, Apigee) can facilitate integration with existing business softwares, EDM, and user directories. our also have experience with message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ, which can help with data exchange between systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the response time requirement of less than 2 seconds, our can leverage our expertise in AI/ML systems, specifically with LLM models like Mistral 7B or Falcon, and inference servers like vLLM or Ollama." ;
