        ex:hasText "As for the proposed architecture, I would suggest a cloud-based infrastructure on Outscale (SecNumCloud) and OVHcloudd Helm for containerisation and orchestration. our can design a microservices-based architecture with RESTful APIs for integration with existing business softwares, EDM, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The LLM model can be deployed using an inference server like vLLM or Ollama, and our can use our monitoring tools to ensure the required availability and response time. our IaC tools, such as Terraform and Ansible, can help automate the deployment and management of the infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, please note that while our current technology stack can meet many of the client's requirements, our should conduct further analysis and testing to ensure that the proposed architecture can achieve the exact availability and response time targets." ;
